 as perfect as could be. I might just revisit one more time before we leave SB. Sorry for not sharing pics; I didn't take the time away from my amazing lunch!"},{"review_date":"2021-11-27 21:29:38","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"Kale falafel burger was absolutely incredible. I've never really actively sought out vegan food, but this has made me start rethinking that. Super great flavor, and so nice to look at!"}],"state":"CA"}","answer":"Fala Bar is a local business located at 38 W Victoria St, Ste 108 in Santa Barbara, CA. This restaurant offers a variety of vegan and gluten-free options, specializing in falafel, Mediterranean cuisine, salads, and sandwiches. The establishment is open from 11:30 am to 4:30 pm on Mondays, and from 11:30 am to 9:00 pm from Tuesday to Sunday.

